area is module
area purpose "Square areas, as a package another project requires"
area path area
area imports standard.math
area imports standard.test
area exports square

square is operation
square purpose "Return a side length times itself"
square invariant sideTimesSide "Returns the side times itself"
square typeParameter none
square input side Int64 copied
square output Int64
square outputOwnedBy none
square raises none
square effect none
square uses none
square memoryHeap false
square async false
square maxRecursion none
square label begin loopKind none
square label begin within none
square let none
square at begin do multiply
square at begin return ok product

multiply is call
multiply in square
multiply invokes math.multiplyInt64
multiply argument left Int64 side copy
multiply argument right Int64 side copy
multiply result product Int64
multiply ownedBy none
multiply cleanedBy none
multiply borrows none
multiply catch none
multiply suppresses none
